    "body": "### Is your proposal related to a problem?\r\n\r\nWith allowing multiple phone numbers and email addresses per person, there is the danger that one user can spam another user by setting the other user's phone number/email address as the first user's destination.\r\n\r\nIf we make a specific phone-number/email address unique for the entire system then a user can \"steal\" a specific phone number/email address from another user and prevent its usage by that other user.\r\n\r\n### Desired solution\r\n\r\nBy allowing a user to see if a phone number/email address is already in use (and by whom) the users themselves have the opportunity to work out which destinations should receive what.",
